# Cases whose golden comes from a fork commit, one name per line, each with
# the change of behaviour it judges. Every case in cases.list not named here
# judges behaviour the fork preserves, and its golden comes from upstream
# v4.8.0. make-golden.sh writes one set or the other, chosen by REF.
#
# ADR-102 step 1 (aaronsb/kmscon): colon sub-parameters, underline styles,
# underline colour (SGR 58/59) and strike-through (SGR 9/29).
sgr-basic                   # SGR 9 sets strike
sgr-underline-extended      # 4:x styles and 58 colours apply; 4;58;5;196 no longer blinks
